        <h2>Free, and <em class="grad">yours to keep.</em></h2>
        <p>Foldergram is free and open source under the AGPL-3.0 license. Self-host it without a subscription, explore the source code, or adapt it to your needs under the terms of the license.</p>
        <p>Help shape the project by reporting bugs, suggesting improvements or contributing code and documentation. Join our Discord community to ask questions, share ideas and connect with other Foldergram users. A GitHub star is another simple way to support development.</p>
        <p>If you enjoy using Foldergram, consider supporting its development on Patreon. Your support helps keep the project actively maintained and moving forward.</p>
